      "id": "dates",
      "title": "Dates",
      "summary": "The CivilDate scenarios of the catalog: real and impossible dates, leap years, years Date can't hold, parsing, weekday and ISO week, adding days and months, days between and order.",
      "subject": [
        {
          "path": "implementations/typescript/src/.dev/feature.json",
          "entityId": "valid-by-construction"
        },
        {
          "path": "implementations/typescript/src/.dev/feature.json",
          "entityId": "month-end-none"
        }
      ],
      "criteria": [
        "CivilDate.of creates 5 November 2026, leap days in 2024 and 2000, +275760-09-13 and -0500-03-01, and throws for 30 February.",
        "CivilDate.tryOf returns invalid with day-out-of-range for 30 February, 29 February 2026 and 1900, and month-out-of-range for month 13.",
        "CivilDate.parse reads 2026-11-05 and returns invalid (day-out-of-range) for 2026-02-30.",
        "dayOfWeek is Thursday and isoWeek 45 for 5 November 2026; isLeapYear agrees with Date for every kind of year.",
        "addDays crosses a month end; addMonths returns none (month-end) for 31 January + 1, and 28 February with Constrain; add(P1M) returns none (month-end).",
        "daysUntil from 5 November to 25 December is 50; isBefore is true when this date comes first."
      ],
      "checks": [
        {
