      "id": "timestamps-and-amounts",
      "title": "Timestamps and amounts",
      "summary": "Instant from a clock reading, the epoch, nanoseconds and a quarter second; exact differences; POSIX versus SI seconds; Date round trips; Period and ElapsedSeconds.",
